su text "n:05340117-n" ob name "thymus" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The anchor 'thymus' is semantically equivalent to the definition describing the ductless glandular organ at the base of; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
