su text "n:05414462-n" ob name "hormone" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The definition describes the secretion of an endocrine gland transmitted by blood, which is the precise meaning of 'horm; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
