su text "n:14658769-n" ob name "chlorine" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The anchor 'chlorine' is semantically equivalent to the definition describing atomic number 17, a common nonmetallic hal; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
su text "sense-gloss:n:14658769-n" ob text "a common nonmetallic element belonging to the halogens; best known as a heavy yellow irritating toxic gas; used to purify water and as a bleaching agent and disinfectant; occurs naturally only as a salt (as in sea water)" ya
