su text "n:14664612-n" ob name "hydrogen" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The definition describes hydrogen, the only element with atomic number 1, matching the anchor choice exactly.; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
su text "sense-gloss:n:14664612-n" ob text "a nonmetallic univalent element that is normally a colorless and odorless highly flammable diatomic gas; the simplest and lightest and most abundant element in the universe" ya
