su text "n:14678354-n" ob name "selenium" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The definition describes a toxic nonmetallic element related to sulfur and tellurium, which corresponds exactly to the '; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
su text "sense-gloss:n:14678354-n" ob text "a toxic nonmetallic element related to sulfur and tellurium; occurs in several allotropic forms; a stable grey metallike allotrope conducts electricity better in the light than in the dark and is used in photocells; occurs in sulfide ores (as pyrite)" ya
