su text "n:14681997-n" ob name "thallium" as text "n" with text "contextual" via text "The definition describes a soft grey malleable metallic element resembling tin that discolors in air, which corresponds; model qwen3.5:9b; sense-link sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-9059730cda6d-d1-model-qwen3-5-9b-definition-anchor-v1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
su text "sense-gloss:n:14681997-n" ob text "a soft grey malleable metallic element that resembles tin but discolors on exposure to air; it is highly toxic and is used in rodent and insect poisons; occurs in zinc blende and some iron ores" ya
